{{!--
Shared visible assessment contract; read before filling any domain template.
assessment: object with id, repository, revision, scope, context, method, outcome, inspected, unassessed; unknown facts must say not supplied; optional visual is evidence-grounded Mermaid plus plain-text explanation when useful and destination supports it.
findings: list with id, claim, status (observed/inferred/unverified), evidence, impact, confidence and basis; no invented ratings.
checks: list with command, scope, kind (existing/experimental), outcome and reason; include failed/blocked/not-run checks.
limitations: list of material limits, missing evidence, conflicts and disclosure constraints.
actions: list of proposed decisions/actions, with supplied owner only.
--}}
